sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Writer W
  participant C as Clustering C
  participant R as Reader
  participant K as Compaction
  C->>C: replacecommit + clustering map {f1..f3 -> f4,f5, h_C}, SOFT replace
  W->>C: residual k -> v1 stays live in f1 (no fold at commit)
  R->>R: read f4 = base(f4) + residual logs(f1..f3), deduped by index
  K->>K: compaction folds residuals into f4/f5 base
  Note over K: after fold, residual logs dead -> cleaner (refcount) removes f1..f3
